================================================================================
                          9. USEFUL COMMANDS
================================================================================

  📋 TERMINAL COMMANDS:
  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

  System Commands:
  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  pkg update                  # Update package lists
  pkg upgrade                 # Upgrade packages
  pkg list-all                # List all packages
  pkg install [package]       # Install package
  pkg uninstall [package]     # Uninstall package

  File Commands:
  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  ls                          # List files
  ls -la                      # List all files with details
  cd [directory]              # Change directory
  cd ~                        # Go to home
  cd ..                       # Go back one directory
  pwd                         # Show current path
  mkdir [name]                # Create directory
  rm [file]                   # Delete file
  rm -rf [directory]          # Delete directory
  cp [source] [dest]          # Copy file
  mv [source] [dest]          # Move/rename file
  cat [file]                  # View file content
  nano [file]                 # Edit file with nano

  DGTLNEX Commands:
  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  python main.py              # Run tool
  dgtl                        # Run with alias
  cd ~/DGTLNEX                # Go to tool directory
  ls DGTL/                    # List protected files
  cat DGTL/protected.html     # View protected file

  Network Commands:
  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  ping google.com             # Check internet
  ip a                        # Show IP address
  ifconfig                    # Network info
  ssh user@ip                 # SSH connection
  termux-wifi-connectioninfo  # WiFi info

